// ChromGraphFM architecture (v1 recipe, configs/base.yaml)
// Eraser flowchart diagram-as-code. Paste into an Eraser "Flow chart" diagram.
// Academic style: monochrome boxes, one accent per stream, no icons.

title ChromGraphFM: contact-biased pretraining of a Hi-C-free DNA encoder
direction right
colorMode outline
styleMode plain
typeface clean

Input [label: "DNA sample\n128 windows x 5 kb = 640 kb\none-hot A/C/G/T/N", shape: rectangle]

Sequence stream (per window, no cross-window mixing) [color: blue] {
  Conv tower [label: "Convolutional tower\nstem + 5 residual blocks\nmax-pool x2 each (/32)"]
  SSM [label: "Bidirectional SSM x 6\ndiagonal, FFT long convolution\nd = 256"]
  Pool [label: "Mean pool + LayerNorm\nwindow embedding h_i"]
  Mask [label: "Masking\n15% of windows -> [MASK] token"]
}

Structure stream (training only) [color: purple] {
  HiC [label: "GM12878 Hi-C, 5 kb\nICE-balanced"]
  Detrend [label: "Distance detrending\nO/E = M_ij / E(s) (all valid pairs)\nc_ij = O/E / (1 + O/E)"]
  Graph [label: "Sparse contact graph\nlocal: +/-3 windows\ndistal: top-16, >= 25 kb"]
  Holdout [label: "Held-out target edges\n15% of distal edges\n(never attended over)", color: orange]
  Dropout [label: "Structure dropout\nremove all distal edges\np = 0.3 per sample"]
  Bias [label: "Edge bias (per head)\nb_ij = MLP_HiC(c_ij) + MLP_dist(log2(1+d_ij))"]
}

Contact-biased attention [color: gray] {
  Attn [label: "Contact-biased sparse attention x 4\n8 heads, attention over graph edges only\nsoftmax(q_i k_j / sqrt(d_h) + b_ij)\nadd & norm, FFN 1024"]
}

Outputs [color: gray] {
  Z [label: "z_i: structure-conditioned representation"]
  Zfree [label: "z_i (Hi-C-free mode)\nlocal edges only\nused at inference and evaluation"]
}

Pretraining objectives (no labels) [color: green] {
  Lmask [label: "Masked-window reconstruction\n|| g(z_i) - sg(h_i) ||^2, lambda = 1"]
  Lcon [label: "Distance-matched InfoNCE\n1 positive vs <= 16 same-distance negatives\ntau = 0.1, lambda = 0.5"]
  Lcontact [label: "Contact prediction\nBCE vs soft strength c_ij, lambda = 1"]
}

Input > Conv tower > SSM > Pool > Mask
Mask > Attn: h_i
HiC > Detrend > Graph
Graph > Holdout: split (fixed control seed)
Graph > Dropout > Bias > Attn: edges + bias
Attn > Z
Attn --> Zfree: dropout mode / inference
Z > Lmask
Z > Lcon
Z > Lcontact
Holdout --> Lcon: positives
Holdout --> Lcontact: targets
